### Conversation requests — POST /v1/chat
### Spec: docs/03 Contracts/API.md, docs/03 Contracts/Agent Context.md
### Run with: JetBrains HTTP Client or REST Client (VS Code).
### Set the variables below with real ids before running.

@host = http://localhost:8000
@tenantId = bc1864b0-8dec-4626-b6cf-bfe7659e8bd7
@actorId = 12025b6b-c7f9-4102-aa5a-bb695008acf8
@customerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000c1
@conversationId =
@newTurnIdempotencyKey = 3f1a2b4c-5d6e-4f70-8a91-b2c3d4e5f607
@continueTurnIdempotencyKey = b7e2c1d4-3a55-4a90-9f62-1c8d0e4f2a33


### Start a conversation (new)
### conversation_id null creates a new conversation. X-Tenant-Id and X-Actor-Id are required.
### Use the conversation_id from the response below as @conversationId for the next request.
POST {{host}}/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Idempotency-Key: "{{newTurnIdempotencyKey}}",

{
  "conversation_id": "ffeefwefew",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Quais sao as empresas que trabalham com voces?",
      "links": [],
      "media": []
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {}
}


### Continue an existing conversation
### Set @conversationId to a conversation_id returned by the previous run.
POST {{host}}/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}

{
  "conversation_id": "{{conversationId}}",
  "customer_id": "{{customerId}}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Quanto custa o plano profissional?",
      "links": [],
      "media": []
    }
  ],
  "idempotency_key": "{{continueTurnIdempotencyKey}}",
  "metadata": {
    "channel": "manual_test"
  }
}
